# Application Kconfig. Zephyr sources this in place of its own root, so the
# trailing `source "Kconfig.zephyr"` is mandatory -- without it every upstream
# symbol disappears.

menu "Clauge"

config CLAUGE_TOUCH_TRACE
	bool "Touch trace diagnostic"
	depends on INPUT_XPT2046
	help
	  Record every XPT2046 report into a RAM ring and dump it as CSV over
	  the console when the finger lifts. Diagnostic only -- enable via
	  trace.conf, never in a release build.


config CLAUGE_PANEL_PILOT
	bool "Build for the two pilot (POC) display panels"
	help
	  The production batch and the two pilot boards carry different
	  display modules. Measured on hardware 2026-08-21, the production
	  panels differ three ways: they render mirrored, they are wired RGB
	  where the ILI9341 driver hardcodes BGR, and their backlight is far
	  brighter at the same PWM duty. The firmware compensates for all
	  three by default, because production is what ships.

	  Set this when building for one of the two pilot boards, which need
	  none of that compensation and would otherwise come out mirrored,
	  colour-swapped and dim. Enable it through pilot.conf:

	    west build -b esp32_devkitc/esp32/procpu . -- \
	      -DEXTRA_CONF_FILE=pilot.conf

	  Deliberately NOT derived from flash encryption. The pilots happen to
	  be the only fused boards today, so keying off FLASH_CRYPT_CNT would
	  work right now and then quietly break: production units get fused
	  before shipping, and the rule would build pilot firmware for them.

config CLAUGE_BL_SCALE_PCT
	int "Backlight duty as a percent of the nominal level"
	range 10 100
	default 100 if CLAUGE_PANEL_PILOT
	default 60
	help
	  Scales every brightness step, so that a given user-facing percent
	  means the same amount of light on either batch. Compared side by
	  side at an identical setting, the production panel had to be
	  stepped down before it matched a pilot, so it is scaled here rather
	  than by lowering the default level -- which would have shrunk the
	  usable 20..100 range instead of recentring it.

endmenu

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
